  <p dir="auto"><strong>The context engine for Enterprise Codebases</strong></p>
  <p dir="auto">
    Indexes any codebase into a knowledge graph — every dependency, call chain, cluster, and execution flow —
    then exposes it through smart MCP tools so AI agents never miss code.
  </p>
  <p dir="auto">
    💬 <a href="https://discord.gg/MgJrmsqr62" rel="nofollow">Discord</a> ·
    🌐 <a href="https://gitnexus.vercel.app" rel="nofollow">Web UI</a> ·
  </p>
</div>
<details open="" class="details-reset border rounded-2">
